OL,3,GNEWSARaac-hit school's new building
OL,4,Aofficially opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school's new building has officially
OL,7,Fopened, three years after dangerous
OL,8,Fconcrete forced the old one to close.
OL,10,FStudents at St Leonard's Catholic
OL,11,FSchool in Durham were forced to take
OL,12,Flessons remotely and in other venues
OL,13,Fafter reinforced autoclaved aerated
OL,14,Fconcrete (Raac) was found in 2023.
OL,16,FOn Friday, its new building was
OL,17,Fofficially blessed by the Bishop of
OL,18,FHexham and Newcastle and declared open.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
