OL,3,GNEWSARaac-hit school's new building
OL,4,Aofficially opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FPE teacher Andrew Bell said initially
OL,7,Flosing the sports facilities had been
OL,8,F"really tough" and praised the new
OL,9,Fsite, saying: "When we first got in
OL,10,Fhere, we couldn't believe our luck."
